t mathematical check, not a Lean-certified counterexample. Acceptance is restricted to this exact source-implicit index correction and its stated source-setting reconstruction. It does not certify all differences between the finite Boolean source and the packet's more general finite-measure/dependent-product Lean statement, validate the implementation or regular conditional-kernel construction, supply a complete source-to-Lean fidelity verdict, or certify a random-site algorithm, sweep, reversibility, or mixing result. The packet and proposal canonical SHA256 values were independently recomputed by sorted-key compact UTF-8 JSON serialization after excluding their respective hash fields and match the values below; the packet file's separate raw-byte SHA256 is 1ad678c1d221062b1afafbc6b2b34475a6301b8a7e2648c7d5dd1e256eb7319e. No self-referential review-run hash is asserted; the coordinating reviewer may hash this immutable result externally.",
